| memory + fallback | 0.182 | 0.305 | 0.372 | 0.583 (RL attacker (vs LF)) | 11/12 | yes |
| switching-heavy mix | 0.181 | 0.278 | 0.432 | 0.594 (RL attacker (vs LF)) | 5/12 | yes |
